ders)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}tree\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S(e,S,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_S,R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;R_S=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(e;S,R_S;T,R_T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}tree\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S(e,S,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_S,R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;R_S=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land R_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(e;S,R_S;T,R_T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the inclusion-order specialization of the general typed tree-embedding predicate; both prefix relations are explicitly restricted to set-sized carriers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-tree9-tree-embedding-—-ZFC-Tree9-Tree-Embedding","text":"df-zfc-tree9-tree-embedding — ZFC Tree9 Tree Embedding","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"31795d01e0ea2e91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,S,T,R_S,R_T,s,t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}tree\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeEmbedding}_S(e,S,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists R_S,R_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&R_S=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in S\\times S:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&\\land R_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R_S)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,R_T)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(e;S,R_S;T,R_T)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1319,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3844","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree9-tree-embedding.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-tree-embedding]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","31795d01e0ea2e91","d25b709595952a78"]}